                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "8 months ago",
                        "rating":  2,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Sorry this is the best stars that could be given. Apart from 餡餅，小米粥, really no dishes was acceptable, especially to the price and service. Very busy and popular restaurant. Maybe for it’s location and long history. Yet the dishes are worse and worse from the fist time we went 10 years ago before moving to this location. Super noisy that we couldn’t talk around the 10-people round table. Dishes were sooo oily, salty and lots of starch. We have been there for more than 10 times as around this neighborhood there is not much choice. Finally we had to quit or only order 餡餅take away. However, even 餡餅 has lost its delicious flavor and satisfying size. Big sigh.. and, super difficult to park.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
