                    },
                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJf6Txn6ABaDQRcpCt0iKmsC4/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkbVltc3pjMVZyU204eVNYTXdUbTVJZVUxcE1uYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "5 months ago",
                        "rating":  4,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Located next to the Fuxing Police Station, this branch of the long-established Beiping Restaurant offers generous portions, no corkage fee, and reasonable prices, making it a great place for gatherings.\n\nThe dishes that left a deep impression that day included cold lamb tripe salad, stir-fried eel with chives, and shrimp floss with lettuce.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "在復興派出所旁，老字號北平餐廳的分店，餐點份量澎湃，不收開瓶費，價格也不貴，是不錯的聚餐地點。\n\n當天印象較深刻的料理有涼拌羊肚、韭黃炒鱔糊、生菜蝦鬆。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
