                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJf6Txn6ABaDQRcpCt0iKmsC4/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSbE0wcFNaak5rUWxwTGJuaFpjekY2YVhST2VVRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "5 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "I pass by often, but I\u0027ve never actually eaten here.\n\nMy family arranged for me to try this restaurant. It mainly serves northern-style noodles and roast duck. They also have shrimp floss. Overall, the noodles are good. For the roast duck, you need to tell the restaurant before they\u0027ll stir-fry the duck carcass, but the duck meat was a bit dry, though overall it wasn\u0027t bad.\n\nFor this price, the food is pretty good. If you like this kind of food, you can give it a try.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "常常經過，但還真沒來吃過\n因為家人的安排，來試試這家餐廳\n偏向北方麵店及烤鴨餐點\n前面還有蝦鬆，整體來說麵點不錯，烤鴨需要告知餐廳他才會再炒鴨架子，但鴨肉部分有些柴，但整體算不差。\n這個價格可以吃到這些餐點算不錯的了，如果喜歡這類餐點的是可以來試試看",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
